---

import Callout from "../Callouts/Callout.astro"

---

<Callout icon="info">
<h4>Not Sure How To Use These Colors?</h4>

<p><strong>Want to copy the color to the clipboard?</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Click on the name of any color to copy the name to the clipboard.</li>
    <li>Click on the definition of any color to copy the CSS definition to the clipboard.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Want to know more about a color?</strong></p>
<p>Click on the solid color (or the 'Info' link) to load up a page full of details, including:</p>

<ul>
    <li>the color's name in Tailwind CSS,</li>
    <li>the color's <code>const</code> name in Javascript and Typescript,</li>
    <li>automated analysis of the color's properties</li>
</ul>
<p>and detailed accessibility guidelines for how to use the color.</p>
</Callout>